      "content": "so it sounds like the critics are mostly just trying to protect the status quo and keep things as they are. if you look at the actual data on student achievement, doesn't it seem like giving parents the choice to leave failing schools is just a more logical and compassionate way to handle the problem than just pouring more money into a system that isn't working?",
